{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/z1xel/SoftSpoken/pulls/36","id":5062694667,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVOzNm88AAAABLcKXCw","html_url":"https://github.com/z1xel/SoftSpoken/pull/36","diff_url":"https://github.com/z1xel/SoftSpoken/pull/36.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/z1xel/SoftSpoken/pull/36.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/z1xel/SoftSpoken/issues/36","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/z1xel/SoftSpoken/pulls/36/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/z1xel/SoftSpoken/pulls/36/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/z1xel/SoftSpoken/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/z1xel/SoftSpoken/issues/36/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/z1xel/SoftSpoken/statuses/a1de2c4aae3b1143a90fcd80db060f8085434e4d","number":36,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Integrate Darnassus terrain-based map fallback and native-style highlights","user":{"login":"z1xel","id":121463840,"node_id":"U_kgDOBz1kIA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121463840?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel","html_url":"https://github.com/z1xel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Scope (Darnassus only)\n\nIntegrates the terrain lookup proven in `SSZTerrainProbe` directly into SoftSpoken Places, without changing upstream map geometry, map navigation or discovery writes.\n\n- Add `UI/TerrainMap.lua` with the Turtle ADT-derived 33x22 area grid and five Darnassus district keys.\n- Add a last-resort `terrain` result to `SSZMapCompat.ResolveAt` **after** POI/native/precise/city/unique-overlay resolution.\n- Extend the existing `SSZMapHighlight` hover manager to render one smoothed BLP2/DXT1 additive highlight at 100% texture alpha, while leaving the existing ClassicAPI overlay path at its original 0.35 frame alpha.\n- Bundle five generated area masks under `Textures/TerrainHighlights`, using the terrain-derived silhouette and a Gaussian round/feather pass, with original-1.12-style dark additive RGB light.\n- Preserve the existing `SSZMapPanel.SelectSubzone` and `SSZLoreWindow.IsLocked` checks. Map hover and clicks never write exploration/visited state.\n- Add static source/BLP header tests and manual acceptance steps in `tools/map/DARNASSUS_TERRAIN_FALLBACK.md`.\n\n## Validation\n\n- [x] Verified the row grid dimensions/area counts against the independently tested probe source.\n- [x] Verified the previously tested Cenarion sample `(0.3543013,0.0978802)` resolves to the Cenarion Enclave chunk.\n- [x] Confirmed the module loads before `MapCompat` and the existing native/overlay path has precedence in source.\n- [ ] **In-game on Turtle WoW 1.12:** confirm all five names, clicks, lore locks, hover highlights, native POI precedence and fullscreen/minimized switching.\n- [ ] **In-game:** confirm BLP2/DXT1 highlight textures load and light properly, and ordinary overlay zones remain unchanged.\n\n**Do not merge until the in-game verification passes.** The current branch intentionally does not attempt to fix the entire 219-place map-gap audit; that work should follow this proven integration.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-29T05:19:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T16:13:14Z","closed_at":"2026-10-29T16:13:13Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha"